request.description:
GET /medicines  [Public]
Returns all medicines sorted alphabetically.

Response 200: { success, data: { medicines: [ { id, name, is_prescription_required, created_at, image_url, price } ] } }

GET /pharmacist/pending-prescriptions
Simple route health check — returns a static success message.

Response 200: { success: true, message: 'Route is working' }

GET /pharmacist/pending-prescription  [No auth guard currently]
Returns all prescriptions with verification_status = 'Pending', joined with order, branch, and customer data.

Response 200: {
  success,
  prescriptions: [ { prescription_id, image_url, uploaded_at, order_id, status, branch_name, customer_name, email } ]
}

GET /admin/branches  [Auth Required — admin]
Returns all branches, each with its full stock inventory and stock status labels.

Response 200: {
  success,
  branches: [
    {
      ...branchFields,
      stock: [ { branch_id, medicine_id, medicine_name, quantity_available, low_stock_threshold, stock_status: 'In Stock' | 'Low Stock' | 'Out of Stock' } ]
    }
  ]
}
Response 401: Unauthorized
Response 403: Wrong role
